    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to no.1 Pine Court, a prestigious 4 bedroom detached home set in the heart of Portmarnock. This magnificent full brick family home is nestled in a small enclave of just 8 houses which boasts flexible accommodation throughout and a sunny south facing rear garden with concrete garden shed.\r\n\r\nThe property briefly consists of a welcoming hall, lounge with interconnecting doors to a private dining room, fully fitted kitchen with breakfast area, utility room and guest wc. On the first floor there are 4 spacious bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite and a family bathroom. The rear garden is maintenance free with a variety of mature hedges, fully walled boundaries, large side entrance and has a sunny aspect.\r\n\r\nIdeally located just a short stroll to Portmarnock Sports & Leisure Centre, both primary & secondary schools, shops, bus routes and a short stroll to Portmarnock Strand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t6.78 x 1.38\tMix of tile & carpet, coving\r\n\t\t\r\nLounge\t4.6 x 3.8\tGas fire with marble surround, coving, wall lights, centre piece, double doors to dining room\r\n\t\t\r\nDining\t3.64 x 3.56\tSliding door to garden, coving, centre piece\r\n \r\nKitchen\t4.3 x 3.6\tAbundance of fitted units with marble counter, extractor fan, dishwasher\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility\t2.3 x 2.2\tFitted units, plumber for washer dryer, sink\r\n\r\nFamily Room\t4.9 x 2.66\tCoving, open fire\r\n \r\nWC\t1.84 x 1.64\tHolders, wc, whb\r\n\t\t\r\nStairs/Landing\t\tLarge hot press, pull down stairs to attic\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t3.45 x 2.8\tFitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t4.36 x 2.75\tFitted wardrobe, mirror\r\n\t\t\r\nMaster Bedroom\t3.66x 3.40\tFitted wardrobe, mirror\r\n\t\t\r\nEnsuite\t       2.22 x 1.82\tShower, tiled floor and partial walls, wc, whb, mirror\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.6 x 1.77\tTiled floor & walls, bath suite, wc, whb, mirror, holders\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 4 \t3.64 x 2.66\tFitted wardrobe, mirror\r\n\t\t\r\nGarden\t\tMaintenance free, mature hedges, fully walled, large concrete shed, boiler room, large side passage, tap, light, fully walled, south facing"
